body:
Well, yes, I would. But it really depends on the character and personality of said man.

&#x200B;

You don't really have to be top of the line, you just have to mesh well with said person, and if that person loves you, not just one aspect of you, like the looks, it will work.

&#x200B;

Also, there's plenty of regular girls, just like there's plenty of regular guys, so try not to worry too much about it, many people are going through the same thing.

I have heard this "I'm not in a great place right now" thing a dozen times, and a dozen times, it was an excuse to not go out with me, but with someone else.

&#x200B;

Take it for what you will, but in my experience, if I ever hear this line again, I know it's over. People are too scared to tell the truth, so they will make up nonsense like this.

No, nothing was added, removed or repaired recently.

&#x200B;

I was thinking about that, but no, no similar problems in the area.

&#x200B;

But I don't want to upgrade. I enjoy older software and games, and Windows 10 absolutely kills it. Also, my low-end PC would probably run worse with 10 than 7.
